{
  "company": "primary company or organization the article is about",
  "event_type": "one of: funding, acquisition, product_launch, security_incident, partnership, regulation, personnel, research, other",
  "amount": "dollar amount mentioned if any, else null",
  "threat_level": "one of: low, medium, high — how significant this is for a competing AI/automation company to know about",
  "one_line": "one plain-English sentence restating the fact, no marketing fluff"
}

Return ONLY the JSON object, no markdown fences, no commentary.

